    "updated_at": "2026-11-16T20:26:46Z",
    "body": "Decision of the maintainer in chat, 2026-11-16:\n\n> \"Decision on 2232; Option1..\"\n\nOption 1 of the findings comment is selected: with a stock, containment Outside on a clearing kind clears from the selected face or edge out to the stock outline. The entry is in the free area away from the face. The last pass is at the face.\n\nConditions that stay:\n\n- The verify check and the post gate do not change.\n- An entry or a pass in the air band past the stock must not go through a fixture.\n- The PR names each golden that changes and says that no real control run was made.\n- The pinned refusal in `crates/app/tests/shoulder_adaptive.rs` becomes a generated toolpath. The PR says so.\n",
